<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Cyber Defense Command Center</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="hero">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="tag">Cybersecurity Portfolio</span>
        <h1>Cyber Defense Command Center</h1>
        <p>
          Security operations, threat awareness, defensive hardening, and risk reduction
          presented in a polished GitHub-ready profile project.
        </p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a href="README.md" class="btn primary">View Repo</a>
          <a href="scripts/security_dashboard.py" class="btn secondary">Run Dashboard</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
      <section class="grid stats">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Risk Posture</h3>
          <p>Moderate</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Security Score</h3>
          <p>82/100</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Monitoring</h3>
          <p>Enabled</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Readiness</h3>
          <p>Prepared</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel">
        <h2>Core Focus Areas</h2>
        <div class="focus-grid">
          <div class="focus-item">
            <h4>Threat Intelligence</h4>
            <p>Monitoring trends, actor behavior, and active security risks.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="focus-item">
            <h4>Defensive Controls</h4>
            <p>Hardening identity, networks, systems, and access paths.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="focus-item">
            <h4>Monitoring & Alerting</h4>
            <p>Reviewing abnormal activity and handling escalations quickly.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="focus-item">
            <h4>Resilience Planning</h4>
            <p>Preparing for recovery, response, and operational continuity.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel">
        <h2>Recommended Actions</h2>
        <ul class="checklist">
          <li>Enforce MFA and just-in-time privilege access</li>
          <li>Rotate exposed credentials and secret material</li>
          <li>Patch vulnerable services and dependencies</li>
          <li>Review logs and authentication events regularly</li>
          <li>Validate backups and incident response plans</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
